      "writtenOn": "2026-09-25T20:00:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for pointing that out. We are deliberately not mirroring the backfill in downgrade: overcloud\u003dfalse is not a valid state in our deployment, no host should ever be false in the database, and this column is a legacy construct we plan to remove. A downgrade that flips stored hosts back to false would re-break instackenv/ocpinventory generation for anyone who rolls back, so we treat the data repair as one-way and only reverse the column default for schema symmetry.",
      "parentUuid": "bd31f1c0_71dc97ce",
